{"id":"446683","name":"香水梨山药汤","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/446683/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香水梨","amount":"1个"},{"name":"山药","amount":"500克"},{"name":"百合","amount":"小许"},{"name":"清水","amount":"300克"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"枸杞","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"山药去皮洗净。","img":"images/446683/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香水梨洗净，山药切块。","img":"images/446683/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"去果核。","img":"images/446683/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切丁。","img":"images/446683/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蜜枣。","img":"images/446683/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"梨块放煮锅里，放入蜜枣。","img":"images/446683/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅烧热水。","img":"images/446683/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入山药焯水。","img":"images/446683/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"冷水冲洗浮末。","img":"images/446683/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"山药放煮锅。","img":"images/446683/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"洗一些百合。","img":"images/446683/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放煮锅里，加清水，跟食材持平即可。","img":"images/446683/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"中火煮开，改小火。","img":"images/446683/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"取枸杞。","img":"images/446683/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻一下锅，山药轻轻就能弄碎。","img":"images/446683/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入洗净的枸杞，煮十几秒即可关火。","img":"images/446683/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/446683/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/446683/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}